	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Tuus, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, est mihi autor, ut scribam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nunc; nam praenunciavit de nuncio et <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>impulit ad scribendum valde officiose.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Valeo <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>dei benignitate, tametsi in magnis sim la<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>boribus neque habeam hic mea commoda, quae <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>alibi soleo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Multa hic potui per hosce 40 <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>dies absolvere partim et partim inchoare, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quae omnia visurus es.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Constitueram <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>fere usque ad natalem domini hic haerere; sed <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>revocor in ducatum cogorque adire, etiam<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>si passim saeviat pestis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Utinam mih<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>i tuus esset animus saltem hac in re et <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>non formidarem eam!</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Si quis me quaerat, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>erit illi nunciandum de meo r<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>editu <placeName ref="l512">Tubingam</placeName>, quamquam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>illic non diu <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sum futurus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Illuc tamen veniat, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>qui me vult; nam saltem meos inveniet.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Iterum fama fert futura <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>comitia, et puto ego futura tandem.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Sed aliud etiam fama fert non sane lae<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>tum nuncium: invalescere persecutionem in <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> et Philippum tentare foedus cum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>principibus aliquot et episcopis Germaniae.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Destruat deus eorum consilia!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Pecunia missa hu<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>c a duce nostro adhuc n.<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>..<note type="misc">d. Schluss d. Satzes fehlt unten an d. Seite.</note></s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Si egomet istuc hac hyeme non venero, m[ittam] <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>procul dubio unum ex meis, qui nonnul<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>la istic agat <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et quidem brevi mittam <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>a<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ut brevi veniam ipse.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvere iube <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>generos atque omnes fratres.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Communices, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>velim, has literas d. <persName ref="p8101">Laelio</persName>, cui sa<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>lutem plurimam a me.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Argen[torati] 14. no[vembris].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/><persName ref="p3375">Vergerius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z11"/><persName ref="p495">Henrico Bul<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>lingero</persName>, ant<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>istiti <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>fratri honoratissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Unter der Unterschrift ist ein Zettel (zu diesem Brief gehörig?) aufgeklebt:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Oro te, mitte Catalogum haereticorum brevem illum, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>in quo te scilicet praetermiserunt, atque una <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>mitte tuam epistolam, quam ad me scripse<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>ra<lb xml:id="p2z24"/>s <pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>d<lb xml:id="p3z2"/>e e<lb xml:id="p3z4"/>o<lb xml:id="p3z5"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
